{"4484760": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spright", "steam_appid": 4484760, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spright is an epic 2D metroidvania about descending into a vast abyss that twists against you the deeper you go. Equipped with only your diving helm, a longsword, and the tools you uncover along the way, you will dive head-on into a world that refuses to give way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">STEP INTO THE WORLD OF SPRIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Starting at surface level, the deeper you descend into the abyss, the more the world twists against you — paths splinter, enemies grow stronger, and the world becomes ever more difficult to navigate/ explore</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/82b6489d9a1949ca8901ba524722f89d.poster.avif?t=1787324557\" width=752 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/82b6489d9a1949ca8901ba524722f89d.webm?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/82b6489d9a1949ca8901ba524722f89d.mp4?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SPRIGHT IS DESIGNED WITH DIFFICULTY IN MIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is sharp, aggressive, and movement-driven. Slash through enemies, hammer armored foes, parry deadly attacks, freeze-to-death enemies with an ice gun, or even use a bazooka to deal extra damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies in Spright are not hack-and-slash friendly and don't like dying! Some reflect, counterattack, become briefly invulnerable,  evade your attacks, and can even grow stronger the longer the fight lasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/5c3f30233085c7b5e720bdd09495fcba.poster.avif?t=1787324557\" width=752 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/5c3f30233085c7b5e720bdd09495fcba.webm?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/5c3f30233085c7b5e720bdd09495fcba.mp4?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique hand-made biomes to explore, off-beat/ optional paths designed for completionists, and dozens of enemies to vanquish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early on, you'll meet tradesman NPCs which help stock you with health flasks and other cool items you can purchase in exchange for items in your inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/a9c1a2a345a62237afd72221da89d561.poster.avif?t=1787324557\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/a9c1a2a345a62237afd72221da89d561.webm?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/a9c1a2a345a62237afd72221da89d561.mp4?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THE JOURNEY BELOW</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, hammer, parry, dash, and outmaneuver enemies in fast 2D combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast handcrafted rooms, ruins, and lost corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take elevators from the depths into strange new areas — even beyond the sea!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete timed challenges that test movement, routing, and mastery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect health flasks, trade-in your items with NPCs, and/ or go on epic side quests with them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge and upgrade your tools to survive deeper forbidden zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim, dash, warp through space, and discover secret routes (you can even teleport?!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts, relics, Crown markers, and optional paths built for curious players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support us with a Wishlist and/ or follow our page</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll see you down in the depths in August, explorer.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spright is an epic 2D metroidvania about descending into a vast abyss that twists against you the deeper you go. Equipped with only your diving helm, a longsword, and the tools you uncover along the way, you will dive head-on into a world that refuses to give way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">STEP INTO THE WORLD OF SPRIGHT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Starting at surface level, the deeper you descend into the abyss, the more the world twists against you — paths splinter, enemies grow stronger, and the world becomes ever more difficult to navigate/ explore</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/82b6489d9a1949ca8901ba524722f89d.poster.avif?t=1787324557\" width=752 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/82b6489d9a1949ca8901ba524722f89d.webm?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/82b6489d9a1949ca8901ba524722f89d.mp4?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">SPRIGHT IS DESIGNED WITH DIFFICULTY IN MIND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is sharp, aggressive, and movement-driven. Slash through enemies, hammer armored foes, parry deadly attacks, freeze-to-death enemies with an ice gun, or even use a bazooka to deal extra damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many enemies in Spright are not hack-and-slash friendly and don't like dying! Some reflect, counterattack, become briefly invulnerable,  evade your attacks, and can even grow stronger the longer the fight lasts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/5c3f30233085c7b5e720bdd09495fcba.poster.avif?t=1787324557\" width=752 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/5c3f30233085c7b5e720bdd09495fcba.webm?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/5c3f30233085c7b5e720bdd09495fcba.mp4?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 unique hand-made biomes to explore, off-beat/ optional paths designed for completionists, and dozens of enemies to vanquish!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early on, you'll meet tradesman NPCs which help stock you with health flasks and other cool items you can purchase in exchange for items in your inventory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/a9c1a2a345a62237afd72221da89d561.poster.avif?t=1787324557\" width=1170 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/a9c1a2a345a62237afd72221da89d561.webm?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4484760/extras/a9c1a2a345a62237afd72221da89d561.mp4?t=1787324557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">THE JOURNEY BELOW</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slash, hammer, parry, dash, and outmaneuver enemies in fast 2D combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore vast handcrafted rooms, ruins, and lost corridors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take elevators from the depths into strange new areas — even beyond the sea!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete timed challenges that test movement, routing, and mastery!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can collect health flasks, trade-in your items with NPCs, and/ or go on epic side quests with them!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge and upgrade your tools to survive deeper forbidden zones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim, dash, warp through space, and discover secret routes (you can even teleport?!)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find shortcuts, relics, Crown markers, and optional paths built for curious players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support us with a Wishlist and/ or follow our page</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We'll see you down in the depths in August, explorer.</p>", "short_description": "Spright is an epic 2D metroidvania about descending into a vast abyss that twists against you the deeper you go. Equipped with only your diving helm and a longswordm